WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.500
(All characters and organisations in this drama are fictional.)

00:00:01.570 --> 00:00:02.840
(Filming with minors followed broadcast guidelines,)

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:03.900
(and generative AI was used in select scenes.)

00:00:07.570 --> 00:00:09.280
Hold on.

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:11.510
Look there.

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:29.400
(1 Year Later)

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:30.400
I was so happy.

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:34.230
Gyu Rim is in a relationship.

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:40.440
Mu Jin.

00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:45.510
- I missed you. - Me too.

00:00:46.450 --> 00:00:47.610
Have you been waiting long?

00:00:48.420 --> 00:00:49.450
We worry that Mu Jin...

00:00:49.450 --> 00:00:52.490
- What did you put on me? - will take Gyu Rim away from us...

00:00:52.590 --> 00:00:54.020
- No. - You put something on me, right?

00:00:54.090 --> 00:00:57.320
- I didn't. - What's this? You did it again.

00:00:57.420 --> 00:00:59.160
- No. - You put this on me, right?

00:00:59.230 --> 00:01:00.360
Don't take it off.

00:01:01.030 --> 00:01:02.200
What is this?

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:04.330
- There's one more. - There's more?

00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:06.130
- Yes. - Where is it?

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:08.540
(Mu Jin's)

00:01:14.670 --> 00:01:15.680
Hi.

00:01:18.380 --> 00:01:19.550
Have you been studying hard?

00:01:20.950 --> 00:01:25.290
- Aren't you hungry? - This is what Mu Jin told us.

00:01:26.290 --> 00:01:27.290
Gyu Rim.

00:01:27.950 --> 00:01:28.990
- Gyu Min. - Oh, you're here?

00:01:29.060 --> 00:01:30.260
- Gyu Rim. - Hey.

00:01:30.660 --> 00:01:31.830
Were you all eating?

00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:35.460
- Honey, what do you want to eat? - I'll have black bean noodles too.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:37.330
One more order of black bean noodles, please.

00:01:37.560 --> 00:01:39.900
- Gyu Seo, I mixed it all for you. - Is it good?

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:43.870
Gyu Seo. Gyu Min.

00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:50.180
"I'm not taking your sister Gyu Rim away from you."

00:01:52.210 --> 00:01:55.220
"I'm coming to you to be a big brother to Gyu Seo...

00:01:55.280 --> 00:01:57.220
- "and a big brother to Gyu Min." - It's okay.

00:01:57.320 --> 00:01:58.320
You're so cute.

00:01:59.520 --> 00:02:01.120
- What should we eat next time? - We...

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:04.460
Decided to trust what Mu Jin said.

00:02:05.830 --> 00:02:06.830
Father.

00:02:10.360 --> 00:02:11.360
Hello, sir.

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:14.200
And who...

00:02:15.040 --> 00:02:16.040
Might this be?

00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:19.040
My name is Kim Mu Jin.

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:21.070
He's Gyu Rim's boyfriend.

00:02:22.780 --> 00:02:23.780
Boyfriend?

00:02:25.880 --> 00:02:26.910
Gyu Rim, you...

00:02:27.450 --> 00:02:28.550
Are dating someone?

00:02:30.220 --> 00:02:33.690
- You two go inside and wash up. - Okay.

00:02:33.990 --> 00:02:35.490
- Goodbye. - Okay.

00:02:35.490 --> 00:02:37.420
- Thank you for the meal. - Sure. Let's eat again.

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:38.490
Let's go again next time.

00:02:51.470 --> 00:02:52.470
Father.

00:03:06.320 --> 00:03:09.020
He's very handsome.

00:03:11.290 --> 00:03:12.460
My Gyu Rim...

00:03:13.090 --> 00:03:14.990
Really landed a catch.

00:03:17.100 --> 00:03:18.130
Thank you.

00:03:18.200 --> 00:03:20.130
If you had such a wonderful boyfriend,

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:22.670
You should have introduced him to me first.

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:27.470
So, how long have you two been seeing each other?

00:03:27.940 --> 00:03:30.310
It's been about one year now.

00:03:30.740 --> 00:03:33.250
I'm sorry for not introducing myself sooner.

00:03:33.710 --> 00:03:36.280
- A year? - Yes.

00:03:36.850 --> 00:03:39.790
If it's already been a year, my goodness.

00:03:40.250 --> 00:03:42.690
Then you must be thinking about marriage, right?

00:03:42.760 --> 00:03:45.020
- Oh, it's not like that. - Yes, it is.

00:03:45.190 --> 00:03:46.960
- Mu Jin. - If you'll give us your permission,

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:49.930
I'd like to marry Gyu Rim.

00:03:52.770 --> 00:03:55.840
I like how straightforward you are, my Son-in-law Kim.

00:03:57.540 --> 00:03:58.540
Well, since we're on the topic,

00:03:58.610 --> 00:04:00.110
Let's just set a date before the end of the year.

00:04:01.110 --> 00:04:02.410
That sounds good to me.

00:04:03.080 --> 00:04:06.010
It's not like that. Not yet, Father.

00:04:06.080 --> 00:04:08.550
We still need to work more, earn more money...

00:04:08.620 --> 00:04:13.190
Earn money? Why? Our Son-in-law Kim is wealthy.

00:04:14.890 --> 00:04:16.490
He's not from a wealthy family.

00:04:16.620 --> 00:04:18.430
He's just a part-timer who works where I do.

00:04:19.490 --> 00:04:21.530
Then why are you working part-time wearing a watch...

00:04:21.590 --> 00:04:23.200
Worth hundreds of thousands of dollars?

00:04:25.100 --> 00:04:28.970
- What? - Oh, the heirs hiding identity...

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:31.940
For management training or something like that?

00:04:32.110 --> 00:04:33.740
I told you, it's not like that.

00:04:33.810 --> 00:04:36.540
Besides, who has a watch worth hundreds of thousands of dollars?

00:04:36.980 --> 00:04:39.650
Did you tell my Gyu Rim you were poor?

00:04:40.050 --> 00:04:41.920
What, because you were afraid my Gyu Rim...

00:04:41.980 --> 00:04:44.220
Would feel insecure and get intimidated?

00:04:44.450 --> 00:04:47.150
Father, you're misunderstanding.

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:52.160
My goodness, this guy is so considerate.

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:54.130
Well, the thing is...

00:04:54.190 --> 00:04:56.400
I told you, it's not like that. Really.

00:04:58.600 --> 00:04:59.600
It's a knockoff.

00:05:05.840 --> 00:05:08.210
- A knockoff? - Yes.

00:05:09.110 --> 00:05:11.210
It's a knockoff from Namdaemun Market.

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:14.410
Then...

00:05:15.220 --> 00:05:17.050
Your belt and shoes...

00:05:17.780 --> 00:05:20.590
Are they all knockoffs, then?

00:05:23.060 --> 00:05:24.190
Yes.

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:26.430
And you're not from a wealthy family?

00:05:28.030 --> 00:05:29.030
No.

00:05:29.360 --> 00:05:30.460
And you're not rich?

00:05:32.230 --> 00:05:34.930
He's just like me, working hard...

00:05:35.130 --> 00:05:37.300
To live an honest life. That's Mu Jin.

00:05:37.370 --> 00:05:39.070
Why would you date a guy like this?

00:05:39.840 --> 00:05:42.080
So the two of you can starve together?

00:05:42.140 --> 00:05:45.180
- Father! - Oh, sure.

00:05:45.250 --> 00:05:48.010
I should've known about your taste in men.

00:05:48.250 --> 00:05:50.020
Break up with him. Right now, while I'm asking nicely.

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:54.190
- Father. - "Hardworking." Give me a break.

00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:57.960
I know his type, okay? A young punk with nothing to his name...

00:05:58.220 --> 00:06:00.030
Is already obsessed with luxury brands.

00:06:00.790 --> 00:06:03.060
I mean, if you can't afford them, then...

00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:06.270
You should just give them up and learn to live within your means.

00:06:06.630 --> 00:06:08.200
But looking at this earlier,

00:06:09.600 --> 00:06:11.400
Even if it's a knockoff,

00:06:11.840 --> 00:06:13.910
It looks like a top-quality replica.

00:06:15.070 --> 00:06:18.950
These knockoff watches still sell for a lot of money.

00:06:19.650 --> 00:06:21.310
It wasn't that expensive...

00:06:21.680 --> 00:06:23.120
Who are you trying to fool...

00:06:23.180 --> 00:06:25.350
With a high-end knockoff like this?

00:06:25.790 --> 00:06:28.620
- Who are you trying to trick? - Father.

00:06:28.690 --> 00:06:29.690
It's a misunderstanding.

00:06:29.760 --> 00:06:30.920
I really only care about Gyu Rim.

00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:31.990
Enough.

00:06:33.190 --> 00:06:35.760
Go. Get lost. Get away from my daughter...

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:36.900
Right now. Got it?

00:06:36.900 --> 00:06:38.830
Father, why are you doing this? Really.

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:41.730
Don't you see it? After looking at me?

00:06:41.900 --> 00:06:43.940
He's just like I was when I was young.

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:45.140
Exactly like me.

00:06:45.570 --> 00:06:48.070
Hey, because she chose the wrong guy,

00:06:48.140 --> 00:06:49.280
Her life was ruined.

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:50.980
Haven't you learned from what happened to your mom?

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:53.950
Mu Jin is different.

00:06:54.110 --> 00:06:56.780
At least he's not like you, deceiving Mom...

00:06:56.850 --> 00:06:59.550
And lying all the time.

00:07:01.750 --> 00:07:03.220
You, get over here.

00:07:03.420 --> 00:07:06.230
Stop hiding behind a woman like a coward.

00:07:06.290 --> 00:07:08.330
Don't just stand there. Get over here.

00:07:08.830 --> 00:07:11.400
Guys like this need a lesson...

00:07:11.460 --> 00:07:13.000
So they don't come sniffing around again.

00:07:13.430 --> 00:07:16.570
You're going to get a beating today. Got it?

00:07:16.900 --> 00:07:18.400
Come here. Hey.

00:07:18.670 --> 00:07:20.640
- Father. - Hey.

00:07:20.710 --> 00:07:22.540
Don't you dare lay a finger on Mu Jin.

00:07:22.680 --> 00:07:25.210
I don't care if you're my father. I won't let it slide. I mean it.

00:07:25.280 --> 00:07:27.750
Han Gyu Rim, move.

00:07:28.310 --> 00:07:29.520
Are you going to move?

00:07:30.080 --> 00:07:32.120
Darn it. You, get over here, you punk.

00:07:32.490 --> 00:07:35.720
- Hey. - Mu Jin, just go. I'll call you.

00:07:35.820 --> 00:07:37.860
Hey, get over here.

00:07:37.920 --> 00:07:39.460
- Mu Jin, just go. Go. - I'll see you next time, sir.

00:07:39.530 --> 00:07:43.060
- Where do you think you're going? - Father, stop it. Honestly.

00:07:43.460 --> 00:07:46.100
- Hey. - I can't believe this.

00:07:46.170 --> 00:07:49.200
- Get inside. You, get inside. - Father, honestly.

00:07:49.270 --> 00:07:51.740
Whose side are you on already?

00:07:51.840 --> 00:07:53.970
You said you wouldn't just stand by. What are you going to do about it?

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:56.710
Are you going to hit me? Unbelievable.

00:07:56.780 --> 00:07:58.780
Hey, Han Gyu Young, Han Gyu Oh.

00:07:59.310 --> 00:08:02.250
Your innocent and naive older sister...

00:08:02.350 --> 00:08:04.920
While she was dating that mindless punk,

00:08:04.980 --> 00:08:06.820
Why didn't you stop her?

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:11.390
- Let's talk about this. - You have to let go of me, Father.

00:08:13.360 --> 00:08:14.730
Gosh, my shoulder.

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:17.060
Hey, Han Gyu Young.

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:21.230
You're supposed to be a good judge of men. What did you do?

00:08:21.300 --> 00:08:23.100
And what did you do, Father?

00:08:23.370 --> 00:08:24.940
If you disapproved so much, you should've...

00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:26.340
Come home and stopped her yourself.

00:08:26.410 --> 00:08:29.280
She was crazy in love. How was I supposed to stop her?

00:08:29.340 --> 00:08:30.340
Han Gyu Young.

00:08:30.840 --> 00:08:33.050
Father, please stop.

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:35.010
I told you I was against it from the start.

00:08:35.420 --> 00:08:36.920
Kicking people out is your specialty, isn't it, Father?

00:08:36.980 --> 00:08:38.320
You kicked out Mom too.

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:39.920
So I guess it's up to you to do whatever it takes...

00:08:39.990 --> 00:08:41.490
To stop Han Gyu Rim, right?

00:08:41.990 --> 00:08:43.120
You...

00:08:44.860 --> 00:08:48.160
Han Gyu Oh, what about you, you punk?

00:08:48.930 --> 00:08:50.360
I was cheering for her.

00:08:50.900 --> 00:08:53.200
I was hoping things would go well with her boyfriend...

00:08:53.270 --> 00:08:56.240
So she could get out of this miserable house.

00:08:56.700 --> 00:08:58.240
I was rooting for her like crazy.

00:08:58.540 --> 00:09:00.010
I can't believe this kid.

00:09:00.270 --> 00:09:02.610
Go for it, Han Gyu Rim. I'm totally rooting for you.

00:09:02.880 --> 00:09:04.240
No matter who you date,

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:06.350
At least they'll be better than Father, right?

00:09:07.050 --> 00:09:09.850
- Why you little... - What about us?

00:09:10.680 --> 00:09:12.190
Why aren't you asking us?

00:09:12.650 --> 00:09:15.990
- I approve. - I'm neutral for now.

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:19.590
- Then why did you eat the noodles? - Hey.

00:09:20.690 --> 00:09:23.230
Elementary schoolers don't get a say. Got it?

00:09:23.930 --> 00:09:28.170
You two, go to your room. Now. Go on, hurry.

00:09:32.940 --> 00:09:34.470
Those two are just the same.

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:37.980
Anyway, I'm...

00:09:39.450 --> 00:09:41.680
Until you tell me you won't see that punk anymore,

00:09:41.750 --> 00:09:43.350
I'm going on a hunger strike.

00:09:44.320 --> 00:09:46.450
If you want to save your father, break up with him.

00:09:47.020 --> 00:09:50.560
If you want to kill your father, then keep seeing that guy.

00:09:51.090 --> 00:09:52.960
Got it? Darn it.

00:10:07.610 --> 00:10:09.480
Should I have just told him it was real?

00:10:11.580 --> 00:10:12.950
Mu Jin is different.

00:10:13.010 --> 00:10:15.680
At least he's not like you, deceiving Mom...

00:10:15.750 --> 00:10:17.320
And lying all the time.

00:10:19.220 --> 00:10:20.720
No.

00:10:22.960 --> 00:10:25.590
What should I do?

00:10:36.740 --> 00:10:39.770
(I'll Protect My Daughter! Hunger Strike: Day One)

00:10:40.440 --> 00:10:44.810
I'll protect my daughter. Hunger strike, day one.

00:11:01.960 --> 00:11:03.960
- Hello. - Hi.

00:11:10.570 --> 00:11:12.710
- Mu Jin. - You're just getting here?

00:11:14.770 --> 00:11:15.780
Long day?

00:11:16.540 --> 00:11:18.540
What are you doing here at this hour?

00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:21.150
I figured I could see you if I came around this time.

00:11:22.920 --> 00:11:25.350
- Can you spare a moment? - Now?

00:11:25.420 --> 00:11:27.750
Yes, now. For about...

00:11:28.520 --> 00:11:30.060
Three hours, give or take?

00:11:30.990 --> 00:11:32.230
Three hours?

00:11:32.360 --> 00:11:35.130
Well, making dinner for the kids and sending them to school...

00:11:35.190 --> 00:11:36.830
Gyu Young or Gyu Oh can do that, can't they?

00:11:37.330 --> 00:11:39.600
What is it? Is it urgent?

00:11:39.870 --> 00:11:41.670
Yes. It's urgent.

00:11:42.130 --> 00:11:43.370
Is it important?

00:11:44.340 --> 00:11:46.670
Yes. It's important.

00:11:48.710 --> 00:11:51.010
I wonder if any stores are open at this hour.

00:12:26.410 --> 00:12:28.110
What's with this fancy car?

00:12:28.210 --> 00:12:30.620
It doesn't look like it's Jung Woo's.

00:12:45.030 --> 00:12:46.230
Where are we going?

00:12:50.800 --> 00:12:51.800
To see my father.

00:12:52.670 --> 00:12:53.670
What?

00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:56.640
I met your father yesterday.

00:12:57.240 --> 00:12:59.550
I want to introduce you to my father.

00:13:01.750 --> 00:13:04.950
Right now? So suddenly? So out of the blue?

00:13:05.580 --> 00:13:07.350
Did I prepare before meeting your father?

00:13:08.320 --> 00:13:09.490
But still.

00:13:11.790 --> 00:13:12.830
Looking like this?

00:13:13.460 --> 00:13:15.190
I'm a total mess right now.

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:18.130
I haven't washed my hair or my face,

00:13:19.200 --> 00:13:20.970
And I'm wearing a tracksuit.

00:13:21.230 --> 00:13:22.540
You're pretty even without washing your face,

00:13:23.140 --> 00:13:24.470
And you look beautiful just as you are.

00:13:25.570 --> 00:13:27.840
But just in case, I brought you some clothes.

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:28.910
Shoes too.

00:13:32.310 --> 00:13:34.550
Want to change at a rest stop?

00:13:36.920 --> 00:13:41.190
- You even brought clothes? - Yes. I wanted...

00:13:41.920 --> 00:13:43.320
To introduce you to my father as soon as possible.

00:13:46.990 --> 00:13:48.590
Still, this isn't right.

00:13:49.360 --> 00:13:50.360
I'm sorry.

00:13:51.360 --> 00:13:52.770
I'm really sorry, but...

00:13:53.200 --> 00:13:55.900
Please just do as I ask this one time, Gyu Rim.

00:14:04.210 --> 00:14:07.950
(Gohyang Rest Stop)

00:15:15.210 --> 00:15:16.220
You look beautiful.

00:15:18.780 --> 00:15:19.790
It really suits you.

00:15:22.320 --> 00:15:26.260
Since you were so insistent, Mu Jin, I'm doing as you asked for now,

00:15:27.390 --> 00:15:29.160
But I have no idea what this is all about.

00:15:30.030 --> 00:15:31.030
Thank you.

00:15:32.400 --> 00:15:33.670
Thank you so much, Gyu Rim.

00:15:36.840 --> 00:15:37.870
Let's go.

00:15:59.730 --> 00:16:01.130
It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:16:02.090 --> 00:16:03.930
My name is Han Gyu Rim.

00:16:05.430 --> 00:16:07.000
If I had known I would be meeting you,

00:16:07.170 --> 00:16:08.870
I would have at least brought some flowers.

00:16:09.770 --> 00:16:10.870
I apologise.

00:16:17.440 --> 00:16:18.710
This is my girlfriend, Father.

00:16:19.780 --> 00:16:21.810
She's the woman I love more than anything.

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:24.880
I'm planning on marrying her someday.

00:16:31.860 --> 00:16:34.590
But I've been lying to Gyu Rim.

00:16:36.400 --> 00:16:38.700
I never meant to deceive her for this long.

00:16:39.330 --> 00:16:41.000
I tried to tell her so many times,

00:16:42.900 --> 00:16:45.910
But I was afraid she'd get scared and run away.

00:16:47.670 --> 00:16:50.110
Oh my goodness, sir.

00:16:50.640 --> 00:16:54.350
You should have told us you were coming.

00:16:54.580 --> 00:16:56.750
Sir, we're in the middle of something important...

00:16:57.120 --> 00:16:58.120
Pardon?

00:16:58.880 --> 00:17:03.190
Oh, yes. Of course. I'll just wait downstairs, then.

00:17:03.260 --> 00:17:05.560
Please let me know if you need anything.

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:07.030
- Okay. - Yes, sir.

00:17:20.740 --> 00:17:21.870
That watch from yesterday...

00:17:23.710 --> 00:17:24.980
It wasn't a fake, was it?

00:17:28.050 --> 00:17:29.780
That incredibly expensive car we came in,

00:17:31.150 --> 00:17:32.420
That's your car, isn't it, Mu Jin?

00:17:34.920 --> 00:17:37.260
And this outfit I'm wearing is super expensive too, right?

00:17:40.430 --> 00:17:41.430
Mu Jin.

00:17:43.960 --> 00:17:45.730
You're not just some poor part-timer, are you?

00:17:50.270 --> 00:17:51.670
Was my father right about you?

00:17:51.770 --> 00:17:53.740
Were you learning how to manage the restaurant?

00:17:55.770 --> 00:17:56.780
Yes.

00:17:58.840 --> 00:18:00.550
I tried to tell you so many times...

00:18:01.950 --> 00:18:03.280
But I was afraid you'd feel overwhelmed.

00:18:04.150 --> 00:18:05.680
I was afraid you'd be angry that I lied to you.

00:18:07.750 --> 00:18:08.750
So...

00:18:10.790 --> 00:18:12.990
I was afraid you'd be disappointed and leave me.

00:18:13.260 --> 00:18:14.430
I couldn't work up the courage.

00:18:16.330 --> 00:18:17.330
I'm sorry.

00:18:20.430 --> 00:18:21.430
I'm sorry, Gyu Rim.

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:24.240
I'm so sorry for lying to you.

00:18:28.370 --> 00:18:29.580
Gyu Rim.

00:18:31.510 --> 00:18:32.680
Please say something.

00:18:38.420 --> 00:18:39.720
Let me think about it.

00:18:43.120 --> 00:18:45.760
- Gyu Rim. - I need to think about it!

00:18:48.390 --> 00:18:50.530
What am I supposed to do in this situation?

00:18:52.360 --> 00:18:53.830
My boyfriend is a rich heir.

00:18:54.870 --> 00:18:56.000
I've hit the jackpot.

00:18:57.670 --> 00:18:59.510
Should I be happy about this?

00:19:01.710 --> 00:19:04.080
Should I be furious with myself...

00:19:04.580 --> 00:19:06.910
For being fooled like an idiot?

00:19:07.880 --> 00:19:08.910
Should I be embarrassed for comforting...

00:19:08.980 --> 00:19:10.050
A rich heir doing management training,

00:19:11.680 --> 00:19:15.150
Acting all high and mighty?

00:19:16.820 --> 00:19:18.090
Or should I decide this isn't right?

00:19:19.960 --> 00:19:22.290
That he's out of my league?

00:19:23.000 --> 00:19:26.370
And that I should end things with a man like Kim Mu Jin?

00:19:28.630 --> 00:19:30.340
I need some time to think.

00:20:01.300 --> 00:20:03.140
Ma'am, we're here.

00:20:06.870 --> 00:20:08.340
- Ma'am. - Yes?

00:20:09.480 --> 00:20:11.310
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:20:27.730 --> 00:20:28.730
Hey, Gyu Rim.

00:20:33.470 --> 00:20:34.500
Is something wrong?

00:20:35.600 --> 00:20:36.600
No.

00:20:37.400 --> 00:20:39.000
Did Gyu Min and Gyu Seo go to school?

00:20:39.740 --> 00:20:41.910
Gyu Seo forgot her bag, so I just dropped it off for her.

00:20:42.670 --> 00:20:45.440
- Thanks. Let's go inside. - About what I said yesterday...

00:20:47.610 --> 00:20:48.650
I meant it.

00:20:51.150 --> 00:20:52.790
I hope you get married soon...

00:20:52.850 --> 00:20:56.090
So you can fly away from this miserable home.

00:20:57.590 --> 00:20:59.730
Gyu Min said he's a good guy, right?

00:21:00.960 --> 00:21:03.860
Don't worry about Father. Just do what you want.

00:21:12.300 --> 00:21:13.410
My mouth is watering.

00:21:21.280 --> 00:21:23.050
Didn't you say you were on a hunger strike?

00:21:25.350 --> 00:21:28.090
At my age, a hunger strike could kill me.

00:21:30.160 --> 00:21:32.690
How can you oppose Gyu Rim with an attitude like that?

00:21:33.330 --> 00:21:36.030
It's fine. I'm a good actor. Watch.

00:21:38.760 --> 00:21:39.770
Look...

00:21:39.830 --> 00:21:42.030
I look like nothing but skin and bones, right?

00:21:42.470 --> 00:21:43.470
No.

00:21:46.140 --> 00:21:48.010
Hey, hey, just say you ate this.

00:21:48.440 --> 00:21:49.580
(I'll Protect My Daughter! Hunger Strike: Day One)

00:21:49.640 --> 00:21:50.640
Darn it.

00:22:01.250 --> 00:22:02.990
What's all that noise?

00:22:04.120 --> 00:22:06.060
While your father is starving to death,

00:22:06.290 --> 00:22:08.390
You abandon your family...

00:22:09.500 --> 00:22:10.800
To go gallivanting around?

00:22:11.560 --> 00:22:14.100
Father hasn't had even one sip of water since yesterday.

00:22:14.170 --> 00:22:16.870
If something happens to him, what are you going to do?

00:22:18.540 --> 00:22:22.410
Are you in your right mind, stuffing your face with bibimbap...

00:22:22.940 --> 00:22:23.940
Before our dad, on a hunger strike?

00:22:24.380 --> 00:22:25.480
I was just eating the kids' leftovers...

00:22:25.540 --> 00:22:28.110
- so they wouldn't go to waste. - That's nonsense.

00:22:28.180 --> 00:22:29.720
Since when do you eat the kids' leftovers?

00:22:31.480 --> 00:22:33.290
Go ahead and eat, Father.

00:22:33.390 --> 00:22:34.390
What?

00:22:36.460 --> 00:22:37.460
What's that...

00:22:37.520 --> 00:22:38.790
What are you talking about?

00:22:38.890 --> 00:22:40.560
Does this mean you're not going to see...

00:22:40.630 --> 00:22:41.630
That guy anymore?

00:22:41.790 --> 00:22:43.730
She's telling you to go ahead and eat...

00:22:43.830 --> 00:22:44.830
Because she knows you were eating.

00:22:44.900 --> 00:22:46.300
I told you I was eating that.

00:22:50.140 --> 00:22:53.410
Starting tomorrow, to stop you seeing that guy,

00:22:53.410 --> 00:22:56.840
I'm going to follow you everywhere. So you'd better watch out.

00:22:59.980 --> 00:23:00.980
Hey.

00:23:01.650 --> 00:23:02.810
Isn't it so savoury?

00:23:02.880 --> 00:23:03.980
No.

00:23:17.430 --> 00:23:18.430
Mu Jin.

00:23:19.500 --> 00:23:22.230
Kim Mu Jin. Did you sprain your ankle?

00:23:22.730 --> 00:23:25.640
Did a snake bite you? Why can't you suddenly walk?

00:23:26.340 --> 00:23:27.340
I don't know.

00:23:28.210 --> 00:23:29.340
I just can't walk.

00:23:30.540 --> 00:23:33.550
You're not injured or anything. You're just saying you can't walk?

00:23:33.910 --> 00:23:35.910
Gosh, you scared me.

00:23:36.580 --> 00:23:37.580
Hey.

00:23:37.850 --> 00:23:40.650
- Let's try walking. - I told Han Gyu Rim everything.

00:23:45.960 --> 00:23:47.490
I brought her to my father...

00:23:49.290 --> 00:23:50.360
And told her everything.

00:23:52.760 --> 00:23:54.670
That I'm not just a part-time worker.

00:23:56.570 --> 00:23:58.270
That I'd been deceiving her this whole time.

00:24:00.370 --> 00:24:02.710
And that's why you can't walk?

00:24:08.480 --> 00:24:10.250
I should have just told her.

00:24:11.920 --> 00:24:13.620
I should have told her everything from the beginning.

00:24:15.090 --> 00:24:16.320
So what did she say?

00:24:17.990 --> 00:24:19.190
I don't know.

00:24:21.230 --> 00:24:22.690
She seemed really mad.

00:24:27.670 --> 00:24:29.640
She seemed so angry...

00:24:30.900 --> 00:24:32.470
That I couldn't even stop her.

00:24:36.840 --> 00:24:38.010
Of course she's mad.

00:24:39.110 --> 00:24:40.680
I'd be furious if I were her.

00:24:42.150 --> 00:24:44.180
"Was this jerk testing me this whole time?"

00:24:44.280 --> 00:24:45.280
"Or..."

00:24:45.620 --> 00:24:47.620
"was he afraid that if I knew he was a rich heir,"

00:24:47.690 --> 00:24:49.250
"I would cling to him and never let go?"

00:24:49.320 --> 00:24:52.120
- Darn it. - Is that why you lied for a year?

00:24:52.190 --> 00:24:54.830
Hey. You know that's not it.

00:24:55.090 --> 00:24:57.230
You know better than anyone that's not it.

00:24:57.300 --> 00:25:00.030
From Gyu Rim's point of view, that's what she might think.

00:25:00.900 --> 00:25:03.070
The only thing she has is her pride,

00:25:03.140 --> 00:25:04.740
And you're the one who hurt it.

00:25:15.780 --> 00:25:17.920
Didn't you know this would happen once you revealed everything?

00:25:18.950 --> 00:25:20.950
That's why you kept worrying about it.

00:25:27.730 --> 00:25:28.760
If it were me,

00:25:28.960 --> 00:25:30.500
I would be clapping like a seal.

00:25:30.560 --> 00:25:32.130
Oh my gosh, what is happening. This is amazing.

00:25:32.200 --> 00:25:34.470
Mu Jin, I'll love you even more from now on.

00:25:35.500 --> 00:25:37.400
I would have accepted it just like that.

00:25:39.810 --> 00:25:41.540
If she cursed at me, I was ready to take it all,

00:25:42.810 --> 00:25:45.980
And if she hit me, I was ready to take that too...

00:25:48.410 --> 00:25:49.880
Darn it.

00:25:50.750 --> 00:25:53.750
What do I do, Jung Woo? I'm so scared.

00:25:54.690 --> 00:25:56.120
What if she just suddenly...

00:25:57.320 --> 00:25:58.590
Says she wants to break up...

00:25:59.890 --> 00:26:01.430
What will I do if she leaves me?

00:26:02.960 --> 00:26:04.730
What do I do if she just runs away from me?

00:26:13.140 --> 00:26:16.010
You'll break up. You won't break up.

00:26:16.980 --> 00:26:18.140
You'll break up.

00:26:18.880 --> 00:26:20.010
You won't break up.

00:26:21.950 --> 00:26:22.950
You'll break up.

00:26:24.650 --> 00:26:25.650
What does it say?

00:26:26.180 --> 00:26:27.650
- You won't break up. - We won't break up?

00:26:27.720 --> 00:26:30.020
- You'll break up. - Come on. Do it properly.

00:26:30.090 --> 00:26:31.760
- Hold on, hold on. - There's another one.

00:26:31.820 --> 00:26:34.390
- Okay, let's go. We can do this. - Okay.

00:26:34.460 --> 00:26:35.590
- You'll break up. - You'll break up.

00:26:35.660 --> 00:26:36.660
You won't break up.

00:26:36.660 --> 00:26:38.000
- You'll break up. - You'll break up.

00:26:38.330 --> 00:26:40.430
You won't break up. You'll break up. You won't break up.

00:26:40.500 --> 00:26:42.700
- You'll break up. - Should've with "You'll break up".

00:26:42.770 --> 00:26:44.500
- Gosh, honestly. - Just do it one more time.

00:26:52.910 --> 00:26:54.680
This is my fifth cup of coffee.

00:26:56.450 --> 00:26:58.120
Seo Hyun, this is your chance.

00:26:58.820 --> 00:26:59.890
What are you talking about?

00:27:01.050 --> 00:27:02.650
Anyway, you said you had some big, good news.

00:27:02.720 --> 00:27:03.720
What is it?

00:27:03.790 --> 00:27:04.920
It's Mu Jin.

00:27:06.860 --> 00:27:08.290
He and Gyu Rim might break up.

00:27:11.560 --> 00:27:12.960
Want me to get you some water?

00:27:16.970 --> 00:27:17.970
For real?

00:27:18.570 --> 00:27:21.640
- Why all of a sudden? - Mu Jin spilled the beans...

00:27:22.010 --> 00:27:23.180
That he's actually...

00:27:23.880 --> 00:27:26.380
- a rich heir. - And?

00:27:27.280 --> 00:27:29.010
And Han Gyu Rim said she wants to break up?

00:27:29.080 --> 00:27:30.250
We don't know yet.

00:27:30.950 --> 00:27:32.820
She was so shocked, she didn't say a word...

00:27:32.880 --> 00:27:33.990
And just left.

00:27:35.990 --> 00:27:37.060
Left and went where?

00:27:37.560 --> 00:27:38.790
Where were they for him to tell her?

00:27:39.260 --> 00:27:41.960
At Mu Jin's father's grave. He told her there.

00:27:42.030 --> 00:27:44.160
He introduced Gyu Rim to his father too.

00:27:44.230 --> 00:27:46.360
He took her all the way to his father's grave?

00:27:48.130 --> 00:27:49.130
Yes.

00:27:50.100 --> 00:27:52.270
And what were you doing?

00:27:52.340 --> 00:27:53.710
While Kim Mu Jin and Han Gyu Rim were getting so serious,

00:27:53.770 --> 00:27:55.470
Why didn't you do anything to stop them?

00:27:55.540 --> 00:27:57.740
You said you were confident you could make her fall for you.

00:27:58.380 --> 00:27:59.710
Well, about that...

00:28:00.680 --> 00:28:03.010
Turns out Gyu Rim is fiercely loyal, just like someone I know.

00:28:03.080 --> 00:28:04.080
Admirably so.

00:28:09.320 --> 00:28:12.390
Darn it, if only you were a little more handsome...

00:28:14.330 --> 00:28:16.130
Or a little uglier.

00:28:16.960 --> 00:28:18.130
And what about you?

00:28:18.200 --> 00:28:19.500
Hey, what have you been doing this whole time...

00:28:19.560 --> 00:28:20.770
Instead of trying to win over Kim Mu Jin?

00:28:20.830 --> 00:28:23.840
He only has eyes for Han Gyu Rim. What was I supposed to do?

00:28:23.900 --> 00:28:25.240
Oh, look at Ms. Smarty-pants.

00:28:25.300 --> 00:28:26.840
You don't even know how to use your good looks.

00:28:26.910 --> 00:28:28.670
My goodness.

00:28:29.670 --> 00:28:31.210
Talk about the pot calling the kettle black.

00:28:31.280 --> 00:28:32.640
Unbelievable.

00:28:54.430 --> 00:28:55.630
Excuse me, could you get up?

00:29:02.210 --> 00:29:03.980
Stop pretending to be asleep.

00:29:04.140 --> 00:29:06.880
Can't you please just give up your seat?

00:29:10.720 --> 00:29:13.050
If she were my sister, I'd have smacked her one.

00:29:18.890 --> 00:29:20.260
Is this your seat, mister?

00:29:21.690 --> 00:29:23.260
That's not it.

00:29:23.330 --> 00:29:25.860
All these elderly people are standing uncomfortably.

00:29:25.930 --> 00:29:27.000
And you're not even really asleep.

00:29:27.070 --> 00:29:28.570
Can't you give them your seat?

00:29:28.570 --> 00:29:30.300
- It's all right. - Right, ma'am.

00:29:30.740 --> 00:29:32.700
This is a regular seat, not one for the elderly, you know.

00:29:33.200 --> 00:29:35.140
My ankle hurts, so I want to sit down too.

00:29:35.370 --> 00:29:36.540
Is there something wrong with that?

00:29:36.610 --> 00:29:38.010
No, it's not wrong.

00:29:38.780 --> 00:29:39.840
It's not.

00:29:40.350 --> 00:29:44.220
But think of your own grandparents. If you give up your seat,

00:29:44.280 --> 00:29:45.720
It will bring you good fortune.

00:29:48.290 --> 00:29:49.960
I don't need any good fortune.

00:29:50.090 --> 00:29:52.090
And I don't have grandparents at home.

00:29:52.390 --> 00:29:53.460
Also, forcing someone to be courteous...

00:29:53.530 --> 00:29:54.530
Is a type of harassment.

00:29:54.660 --> 00:29:56.430
If you're so desperate for them to have a seat,

00:29:56.490 --> 00:29:58.130
You could have thrown yourself or your bag...

00:29:58.200 --> 00:29:59.760
To save an empty seat for them.

00:29:59.830 --> 00:30:02.770
Right, right. My mistake.

00:30:03.370 --> 00:30:05.200
I shouldn't have opened my mouth.

00:30:05.270 --> 00:30:07.510
Go on, just sit there comfortably for the rest of the ride.

00:30:13.310 --> 00:30:16.820
No wonder your ankle hurts, wearing shoes like that.

00:30:17.420 --> 00:30:18.680
This guy is unbelievable.

00:30:18.850 --> 00:30:21.420
What I wear is none of your business.

00:30:21.550 --> 00:30:23.020
The nerve of some people.

00:30:23.150 --> 00:30:25.020
- What's the world coming to? - The nerve of some people.

00:30:25.090 --> 00:30:26.660
This world is going to the dogs.

00:30:28.790 --> 00:30:32.060
How pitiful. Those poor shoes.

00:30:47.410 --> 00:30:49.810
What the? Is he following me?

00:30:50.350 --> 00:30:51.420
Darn it.

00:31:05.130 --> 00:31:06.130
Darn it.

00:31:12.200 --> 00:31:13.370
Oh my!

00:31:13.670 --> 00:31:16.040
Oh, dear. Miss.

00:31:16.210 --> 00:31:19.480
Miss, are you all right? Try to get up. Oh, dear.

00:31:19.610 --> 00:31:20.610
My gosh.

00:31:21.550 --> 00:31:22.880
Are you okay?

00:31:23.620 --> 00:31:25.620
Why were you following me? It was creepy.

00:31:25.980 --> 00:31:28.850
What? Me? When did I do that?

00:31:28.920 --> 00:31:30.560
Just because I said something to you on the bus...

00:31:30.620 --> 00:31:34.090
- you followed me to get revenge. - Revenge?

00:31:34.890 --> 00:31:36.800
If you keep following me, I'm going to scream.

00:31:38.160 --> 00:31:39.160
Give me a break.

00:31:40.670 --> 00:31:42.330
What, do you think you're the only one who lives here?

00:31:42.830 --> 00:31:44.270
I live here too, you know.

00:31:44.440 --> 00:31:47.270
What, you want me to show you my ID? Here. Look. See for yourself. Here.

00:31:48.370 --> 00:31:49.370
See?

00:31:51.280 --> 00:31:53.210
Seriously. What do you take me for?

00:31:57.180 --> 00:32:00.020
Oh, dear. They all fell out.

00:32:00.120 --> 00:32:01.120
Darn it.

00:32:01.950 --> 00:32:03.420
Hey, can I give you a hand with that?

00:32:04.190 --> 00:32:05.520
I'm good at this. Here, let me see.

00:32:06.590 --> 00:32:08.160
Wow, this is really, really bent out of shape.

00:32:08.230 --> 00:32:09.230
All right.

00:32:09.560 --> 00:32:10.560
Wait a second.

00:32:11.560 --> 00:32:12.560
There.

00:32:15.930 --> 00:32:18.240
Wow, that's on there good and solid now.

00:32:19.070 --> 00:32:20.070
There you go.

00:32:20.570 --> 00:32:23.040
It's on there tight, right? Here.

00:32:25.410 --> 00:32:26.910
Are you insane?

00:32:27.410 --> 00:32:28.550
It's all right.

00:32:28.610 --> 00:32:30.750
It's not like it was some amazing skill or anything.

00:32:30.820 --> 00:32:31.920
Do you know how much these shoes cost?

00:32:31.980 --> 00:32:33.120
You just banged them all up. Darn it,

00:32:33.180 --> 00:32:34.220
They're all scratched and scuffed.

00:32:34.620 --> 00:32:35.620
What are you going to do about this?

00:32:35.690 --> 00:32:36.690
Pay for them.

00:32:37.490 --> 00:32:40.930
I try to do a good deed, and this is the thanks I get?

00:32:41.390 --> 00:32:42.890
I fixed them. Pay for the repair...

00:32:42.960 --> 00:32:45.830
- or at least thank me. - When did I ask you to fix them?

00:32:46.430 --> 00:32:48.030
You grabbed my shoes and completely ruined them.

00:32:48.370 --> 00:32:51.570
Besides, if you hadn't been creepily following me in the first place,

00:32:52.000 --> 00:32:53.470
I wouldn't have fallen while trying to get away.

00:32:54.340 --> 00:32:56.140
I'm so upset.

00:32:58.010 --> 00:32:59.610
What is this now?

00:33:01.450 --> 00:33:03.550
Hey, I'm the one who should be crying here.

00:33:04.780 --> 00:33:06.080
All right, all right. I'll pay for them.

00:33:06.350 --> 00:33:07.850
I'll pay for them, and that'll be the end of it, okay?

00:33:10.050 --> 00:33:11.590
Don't cry. Just wait a second.

00:33:21.170 --> 00:33:22.170
Here, check it.

00:33:25.300 --> 00:33:26.300
(Nara Bank)

00:33:31.780 --> 00:33:33.510
You could've just transferred the money from your phone.

00:33:35.250 --> 00:33:36.250
Do you not know how?

00:33:36.710 --> 00:33:38.950
- You've never done it before? - I know how to do it.

00:33:40.080 --> 00:33:41.220
Just because I didn't transfer the money,

00:33:41.290 --> 00:33:43.820
You're treating me like I'm from the Stone Age or something.

00:33:46.090 --> 00:33:47.130
Here. Take this.

00:33:48.060 --> 00:33:49.230
Wear them or don't.

00:33:51.000 --> 00:33:52.000
I'm fine.

00:33:55.300 --> 00:33:57.300
That wretched, rotten girl.

00:33:57.370 --> 00:34:00.440
I hope she doesn't get ten steps before her feet start to hurt.

00:34:01.740 --> 00:34:03.170
Hmph. I'll just give these to my mom.

00:34:14.090 --> 00:34:17.860
(Kids with no one at home to feed them or who are hungry...)

00:34:23.460 --> 00:34:27.100
(Kids with no one at home to feed them or who are hungry,)

00:34:27.100 --> 00:34:29.130
(eat your fill. It's on the house.)

00:34:31.640 --> 00:34:32.840
Oh my, you startled me.

00:34:33.470 --> 00:34:34.470
Can I help you with this?

00:34:35.740 --> 00:34:36.740
Oh, yes.

00:34:41.450 --> 00:34:42.780
(Eat your fill. It's on the house.)

00:34:44.020 --> 00:34:45.950
Oh, thank you so much.

00:34:46.880 --> 00:34:48.390
Are you a student?

00:34:49.920 --> 00:34:51.020
Yes, I guess...

00:34:56.830 --> 00:34:59.160
All right, what can I get for you?

00:34:59.830 --> 00:35:01.530
One serving each of tteokbokki, sundae,

00:35:01.600 --> 00:35:05.240
- and fried snacks to go, please. - Okay, and for the sundae?

00:35:05.600 --> 00:35:07.740
And what kind of fried snacks would you like?

00:35:07.970 --> 00:35:10.010
Just the sausage and liver for the sundae, please.

00:35:10.070 --> 00:35:11.910
For the fried snacks, just give me a mix of whatever.

00:35:12.140 --> 00:35:15.110
Well, I have to slice the sundae and heat up the fried snacks,

00:35:15.580 --> 00:35:18.420
So have something to eat while you wait. Whatever you want.

00:35:18.850 --> 00:35:22.290
As a little thank you for helping me with that paper,

00:35:23.120 --> 00:35:24.390
It's on the house.

00:35:25.220 --> 00:35:26.220
Thank you.

00:35:31.360 --> 00:35:34.870
Goodness, don't be shy. Dig in.

00:35:35.730 --> 00:35:38.270
It's the signature dish of our food cart.

00:35:38.640 --> 00:35:40.470
Have a taste of the fish cake first.

00:35:41.070 --> 00:35:42.810
I'm telling you, it's to die for.

00:35:46.040 --> 00:35:47.050
Go on, try it.

00:35:48.780 --> 00:35:49.780
Thank you.

00:35:54.350 --> 00:35:56.020
So? It's delicious, right?

00:35:57.160 --> 00:36:00.220
- Yes. - Grandma's tteokbokki is the best.

00:36:00.290 --> 00:36:02.060
- You should stop eating. - Grandma.

00:36:02.130 --> 00:36:03.930
- Oh my, Hee Na. You're here. - Hello.

00:36:04.000 --> 00:36:05.130
- Yes. - And I see you brought your shadow.

00:36:05.200 --> 00:36:06.960
- Yes. - It's my treat.

00:36:09.200 --> 00:36:10.230
Wait, what?

00:36:11.440 --> 00:36:15.570
It's you, right? It was about a year ago...

00:36:15.870 --> 00:36:16.870
Do you know him?

00:36:18.640 --> 00:36:20.680
It's nothing...

00:36:22.550 --> 00:36:24.680
I'll send the wages I couldn't give you...

00:36:24.750 --> 00:36:27.290
Last time to your account. Please give me your account number.

00:36:28.620 --> 00:36:30.190
No, it's okay. I wasn't trying to get paid.

00:36:32.560 --> 00:36:34.190
Wages? What part-time job?

00:36:35.360 --> 00:36:37.660
It's a long story.

00:36:37.730 --> 00:36:40.470
Look, Grandma needs to use the restroom for a bit,

00:36:40.530 --> 00:36:42.200
So, Hee Na, you watch the cart.

00:36:42.200 --> 00:36:44.900
Is that the place where you fell because the floor was slippery?

00:36:44.970 --> 00:36:47.870
- That's the one. - I'll go. What if you fall again?

00:36:48.510 --> 00:36:51.480
- Oh, I'll be fine. - Come on, let's go together.

00:36:52.140 --> 00:36:53.510
Honey, watch the cart for a bit.

00:36:53.580 --> 00:36:54.580
Okay.

00:36:54.680 --> 00:36:56.880
- Let's go, Grandma. - While I'm gone,

00:36:56.950 --> 00:36:59.250
Eat whatever you want while you wait.

00:36:59.550 --> 00:37:01.450
- Okay. - All right.

00:37:20.970 --> 00:37:22.570
Hey, my baby.

00:37:23.940 --> 00:37:24.940
Are you up?

00:37:25.510 --> 00:37:26.510
I was going to wake you,

00:37:26.580 --> 00:37:27.580
But you were sleeping so beautifully,

00:37:27.650 --> 00:37:28.680
So I just left.

00:37:29.880 --> 00:37:31.750
Should we meet around seven?

00:37:32.480 --> 00:37:34.090
Yes, I'll come pick you up.

00:37:35.350 --> 00:37:36.350
Yes, me too.

00:37:37.560 --> 00:37:38.560
Okay.

00:37:38.760 --> 00:37:41.090
I love you. Right.

00:37:45.860 --> 00:37:46.860
What are you looking at?

00:37:52.940 --> 00:37:56.870
- Here you go. Enjoy and come again. - Oh, yes.

00:38:02.850 --> 00:38:05.450
Are you sure you don't want your wages?

00:38:07.420 --> 00:38:08.420
I hope you have a great night, Grandma.

00:38:08.950 --> 00:38:11.260
Oh, I told you it's fine, really.

00:38:12.020 --> 00:38:13.660
- Oh dear. - Seriously, who is he?

00:38:16.530 --> 00:38:18.260
A very stubborn part-timer.

00:38:19.230 --> 00:38:20.430
(City Bus Route Map)

00:38:31.810 --> 00:38:33.580
(Mu Jin)

00:38:38.120 --> 00:38:40.920
(Mu Jin)

00:38:46.260 --> 00:38:47.260
I'm sorry.

00:38:47.630 --> 00:38:49.590
I really didn't mean to lie to you.

00:38:50.390 --> 00:38:51.830
I swear on my father.

00:38:52.760 --> 00:38:54.600
You're not sick or in trouble, are you?

00:38:55.830 --> 00:38:56.970
I'm worried,

00:38:57.030 --> 00:38:59.100
So if you're okay, just send me a period.

00:39:01.370 --> 00:39:03.710
(Park Entrance)

00:39:11.650 --> 00:39:12.650
Han Gyu Rim?

00:39:15.750 --> 00:39:16.750
Who are you?

00:39:17.590 --> 00:39:19.060
I'm Chairman Hong Ok Seon's secretary.

00:39:20.120 --> 00:39:21.890
Who is Chairman Hong Ok Seon?

00:39:23.390 --> 00:39:25.260
She's Kim Mu Jin's mother.

00:39:26.100 --> 00:39:29.030
The Chairman would like to see you for a moment.

00:39:32.040 --> 00:39:33.540
But I have to get to my part-time job...

00:39:33.840 --> 00:39:36.010
I've already informed the restaurant.

00:39:52.720 --> 00:39:55.360
Did you go to the late chairman's grave with him today?

00:39:56.790 --> 00:39:58.100
Yes, well...

00:39:58.360 --> 00:40:01.370
I went to pay my respects at Mu Jin's father's grave.

00:40:02.300 --> 00:40:03.300
Let's go.

00:40:10.540 --> 00:40:13.540
(Park Entrance)

00:40:43.940 --> 00:40:44.940
Thank you.

00:41:04.500 --> 00:41:06.600
(Chairman Hong Ok Seon)

00:41:13.940 --> 00:41:15.370
Is something wrong with Gyu Rim?

00:41:16.270 --> 00:41:17.270
Is she sick?

00:41:17.710 --> 00:41:19.780
I mean, she's been late before,

00:41:19.840 --> 00:41:21.650
But she's never missed a single day of work.

00:41:44.700 --> 00:41:46.800
Gyu Rim isn't home right now.

00:41:47.310 --> 00:41:48.540
She went to her part-time job.

00:41:49.410 --> 00:41:50.410
Is that right?

00:41:59.950 --> 00:42:01.190
(Gyu Rim)

00:42:01.920 --> 00:42:04.990
The phone is off, so you will be connected to voicemail.

00:42:05.120 --> 00:42:07.560
Call charges will apply after the tone...

00:42:09.690 --> 00:42:10.700
Thanks.

00:42:13.360 --> 00:42:15.470
- Come in. - Welcome.

00:42:15.830 --> 00:42:17.640
Hello.

00:42:18.100 --> 00:42:20.540
- It's been a while. - Yes, it certainly has.

00:42:20.710 --> 00:42:23.010
I called Hoon Tae to ask him out for a meal,

00:42:23.070 --> 00:42:26.110
But he said he wouldn't eat with another woman without his wife.

00:42:26.180 --> 00:42:28.350
There you go talking nonsense again, Chairman Hong.

00:42:28.680 --> 00:42:31.150
I've been asking her to have a meal with me for years,

00:42:31.220 --> 00:42:33.020
And she never comes, and now she just shows up out of the blue.

00:42:33.480 --> 00:42:34.520
It's good to see you.

00:42:34.820 --> 00:42:36.790
I made spicy braised pork ribs.

00:42:36.850 --> 00:42:38.090
You're all right with spicy food, aren't you?

00:42:38.320 --> 00:42:40.490
It's my absolute favourite.

00:42:41.330 --> 00:42:43.060
I've actually been really stressed out lately,

00:42:43.190 --> 00:42:45.630
And I was craving something spicy. Thank you.

00:42:46.030 --> 00:42:47.160
After hearing so much about it,

00:42:47.230 --> 00:42:49.370
I finally get to taste Seo Hyun's mom's cooking.

00:42:49.430 --> 00:42:50.500
Oh, please.

00:42:51.100 --> 00:42:53.000
Hey, don't go spreading rumours, all right?

00:42:53.070 --> 00:42:55.040
It'll be a pain if people start flocking here.

00:42:56.170 --> 00:42:59.280
It's well past mealtime. You must be starving, right?

00:42:59.480 --> 00:43:00.480
Come on.

00:43:03.210 --> 00:43:07.220
(28 Sadangbon-ro)

00:43:24.900 --> 00:43:25.900
Oh, my.

00:43:28.340 --> 00:43:30.110
- She's really digging in. - This is delicious.

00:43:31.710 --> 00:43:34.910
Seo Hyun's mom, I heard you don't use any housekeepers?

00:43:35.810 --> 00:43:36.810
That's right.

00:43:36.980 --> 00:43:39.120
When it comes to feeding and clothing my family,

00:43:39.280 --> 00:43:40.820
I want to do it with my own two hands.

00:43:41.690 --> 00:43:44.990
- But I do hire people to clean. - Hey, you'll get indigestion.

00:43:45.090 --> 00:43:46.690
I'm not going to steal it from you, so eat slowly.

00:43:46.760 --> 00:43:49.360
Oh my. It doesn't taste as good if I eat it slowly.

00:43:50.590 --> 00:43:54.900
Hey, your wife's cooking is no joke.

00:43:54.970 --> 00:43:55.970
Right?

00:43:56.030 --> 00:43:59.570
Out of everything I've ever eaten, this is the best. Really.

00:44:00.100 --> 00:44:01.110
Excuse me.

00:44:01.170 --> 00:44:03.840
I'll invest. Why don't you open a restaurant?

00:44:04.010 --> 00:44:06.380
Oh, I'm not good enough to open a restaurant.

00:44:07.610 --> 00:44:08.680
I'll let you two talk.

00:44:08.950 --> 00:44:11.250
- Let me know if you need anything. - Okay.

00:44:11.420 --> 00:44:13.280
Please, join us.

00:44:13.850 --> 00:44:15.290
I brought this wine, too.

00:44:15.290 --> 00:44:16.420
It was hard to get, so please have some with us.

00:44:16.950 --> 00:44:19.690
I'm completely charmed by you.

00:44:19.760 --> 00:44:20.860
I want to be friends.

00:44:20.930 --> 00:44:22.860
She's right. Come have a glass of wine with us.

00:44:22.930 --> 00:44:23.930
Sit down. Come on.

00:44:24.160 --> 00:44:25.160
All right, then.

00:44:25.500 --> 00:44:26.900
Come on, sit down.

00:44:27.870 --> 00:44:28.870
What was that?

00:44:29.900 --> 00:44:31.700
Mu Jin is seeing someone else?

00:44:33.770 --> 00:44:35.670
Then where does that leave our Seo Hyun?

00:44:35.840 --> 00:44:38.880
She can't hold a candle to Seo Hyun.

00:44:40.210 --> 00:44:41.210
Of all the people to date,

00:44:41.210 --> 00:44:42.780
How could he choose someone so beneath him?

00:44:43.110 --> 00:44:44.980
He must be out of his mind.

00:44:45.080 --> 00:44:46.080
Unbelievable.

00:44:46.350 --> 00:44:47.350
Still...

00:44:47.950 --> 00:44:50.550
Your son must see something good in her,

00:44:50.620 --> 00:44:51.760
Which is why he's dating her, don't you think?

00:44:51.990 --> 00:44:52.990
Something good?

00:44:53.420 --> 00:44:54.430
Listen.

00:44:55.630 --> 00:44:58.730
I had my assistant, Secretary Cha, do a background check on her.

00:44:59.260 --> 00:45:01.100
She comes from a dirt-poor family.

00:45:01.170 --> 00:45:03.370
She has a single father and a bunch of younger siblings.

00:45:03.830 --> 00:45:05.870
And on top of that, she only has a high school diploma.

00:45:06.440 --> 00:45:08.270
Who knows what she was doing,

00:45:08.340 --> 00:45:10.770
But she couldn't even get into a college that anyone can get into.

00:45:11.140 --> 00:45:13.510
And our Seo Hyun lost to a girl like that?

00:45:14.180 --> 00:45:15.280
It really hurts my pride.

00:45:15.910 --> 00:45:17.780
I mean, does Mu Jin have such bad judgment?

00:45:17.850 --> 00:45:18.880
Is he that bad at judging women?

00:45:19.550 --> 00:45:21.520
- Honey. - Honestly.

00:45:22.790 --> 00:45:26.060
So, how did they meet?

00:45:26.120 --> 00:45:28.490
She works at the restaurant where our Mu Jin is in training.

00:45:28.490 --> 00:45:30.230
She's a part-timer there.

00:45:31.300 --> 00:45:32.400
According to Secretary Cha,

00:45:32.460 --> 00:45:35.030
She probably doesn't know who Mu Jin really is, but...

00:45:35.100 --> 00:45:37.530
No, no. She knows exactly who he is.

00:45:37.600 --> 00:45:40.240
She thinks she's hit the jackpot. She's stuck to him like a leech...

00:45:40.300 --> 00:45:42.810
And is just sucking him dry. That little witch.

00:45:43.210 --> 00:45:44.210
She must be a gold digger.

00:45:44.280 --> 00:45:47.040
Oh, right. A gold digger. Yes. She must be a gold digger.

00:45:47.110 --> 00:45:48.850
- Honey. - What?

00:45:48.910 --> 00:45:51.220
Oh, why are you acting so unlike yourself?

00:45:52.380 --> 00:45:55.290
Because I'm upset. Okay? I mean, our Seo Hyun.

00:45:55.350 --> 00:45:57.020
What could she possibly be lacking?

00:45:58.390 --> 00:46:01.160
Oh, forget it. A guy like Mu Jin.

00:46:01.230 --> 00:46:04.030
- I wouldn't take him by truckload. - Oh, honestly.

00:46:04.160 --> 00:46:06.230
Oh, this man. Are you drunk?

00:46:06.300 --> 00:46:07.530
Hey, don't worry.

00:46:08.030 --> 00:46:09.370
I'll take care of everything.

00:46:10.370 --> 00:46:12.600
I mean, how could I accept someone so beneath us...

00:46:12.670 --> 00:46:14.240
As my daughter-in-law?

00:46:15.210 --> 00:46:16.210
Hey, do you know who I am?

00:46:16.410 --> 00:46:17.610
I'm Hong Ok Seon.

00:46:17.940 --> 00:46:20.540
The sky could fall, and it would still be impossible.

00:46:21.380 --> 00:46:24.250
Oh, I'll go make some soup to help you sober up.

00:46:24.620 --> 00:46:26.480
Let's have our children marry.

00:46:26.880 --> 00:46:27.890
- Seriously? - What?

00:46:27.950 --> 00:46:30.290
Who says we'll be in-laws? I told you I don't want to.

00:46:30.550 --> 00:46:32.620
I told you I wouldn't take Mu Jin even if he came by the truckload.

00:46:32.760 --> 00:46:33.760
Not with you, Hoon Tae.

00:46:33.820 --> 00:46:35.730
I said I'm becoming in-laws with Yoon Hee. Why?

00:46:36.460 --> 00:46:37.460
You know, Yoon Hee,

00:46:37.530 --> 00:46:39.560
I was completely charmed by you today.

00:46:40.060 --> 00:46:42.100
My mother used to say,

00:46:42.330 --> 00:46:43.570
When a mother can make such a wonderful...

00:46:43.670 --> 00:46:47.770
And comforting meal, the daughter she raises...

00:46:47.840 --> 00:46:49.410
Is a bride you should take, sight unseen.

00:46:49.610 --> 00:46:50.610
Enough of that.

00:46:50.740 --> 00:46:54.210
- Thank you for your kind words. - Hey, it's time for you to go. Go.

00:46:54.780 --> 00:46:55.780
My feelings are hurt today.

00:46:55.850 --> 00:46:57.410
You're finished eating, right? Go home. Now.

00:46:57.480 --> 00:46:58.880
Honey, honestly.

00:46:59.250 --> 00:47:02.190
Please, you have to let me have Seo Hyun.

00:47:02.490 --> 00:47:04.460
No, it's just because they grew up together.

00:47:04.520 --> 00:47:06.620
He just doesn't see her as a woman yet.

00:47:07.060 --> 00:47:09.430
Mu Jin will come to his senses. All right?

00:47:09.490 --> 00:47:11.900
I said that's enough, Chairman Hong.

00:47:11.900 --> 00:47:13.460
All right? I'm the one who's against it.

00:47:13.530 --> 00:47:14.900
I have my pride too, you know.

00:47:15.800 --> 00:47:17.430
We will absolutely not become in-laws.

00:47:17.900 --> 00:47:19.070
My gosh.

00:47:19.570 --> 00:47:21.470
- Cheers. - Right, cheers.

00:47:21.540 --> 00:47:24.380
Not with you. Cheers. Yoon Hee, cheers.

00:47:24.910 --> 00:47:26.110
So what are you going to do about it?

00:47:43.030 --> 00:47:44.030
Where's the Chairman?

00:47:44.960 --> 00:47:46.430
She had something urgent come up today,

00:47:46.500 --> 00:47:47.730
So she had to step out.

00:47:49.100 --> 00:47:50.500
The person who asked to meet me today,

00:47:50.570 --> 00:47:51.700
Wasn't that the Chairman?

00:47:51.840 --> 00:47:52.840
Well...

00:47:53.570 --> 00:47:55.810
After rethinking it,

00:47:56.510 --> 00:47:58.980
The Chairman decided that there was no longer a need...

00:47:58.980 --> 00:48:00.740
Or value in meeting with you directly.

00:48:14.660 --> 00:48:15.660
What is this?

00:48:17.560 --> 00:48:18.560
It's 100,000 dollars.

00:48:21.500 --> 00:48:22.830
Is this how you tell me to break up with Mu Jin?

00:48:22.900 --> 00:48:25.270
In such a petty and cruel way?

00:48:28.670 --> 00:48:30.640
If it's not enough, we can offer you more.

00:48:35.010 --> 00:48:37.180
- Give me 100,000,000 dollars. - One hundred...

00:48:39.150 --> 00:48:40.620
Did you say 100,000,000 dollars?

00:48:40.750 --> 00:48:43.750
You're asking me to put a price tag on my feelings for Mu Jin, right?

00:48:44.660 --> 00:48:45.660
Give me 100,000,000 dollars.

00:48:46.320 --> 00:48:47.390
Han Gyu Rim.

00:48:47.520 --> 00:48:50.430
I may not be very educated, but I'm good at basic math.

00:48:50.960 --> 00:48:52.130
Anything less is out of the question.

00:48:52.830 --> 00:48:55.330
Give me 100,000,000 dollars. Then I'll break up with him.

00:48:57.870 --> 00:49:01.310
(28 Sadangbon-ro)

00:49:07.610 --> 00:49:10.510
(Gyu Rim)

00:49:14.790 --> 00:49:15.790
Where are you?

00:49:16.650 --> 00:49:19.660
- Are you trying to drive me crazy? - I'm hungry.

00:49:20.190 --> 00:49:21.630
I'm starving.

00:49:22.460 --> 00:49:25.460
(Damga Charcoal Grill)

00:49:34.370 --> 00:49:35.370
Over here.

00:49:54.360 --> 00:49:55.360
Gyu Rim.

00:49:58.460 --> 00:50:00.830
You're here. Sit down.

00:50:01.970 --> 00:50:03.330
You haven't eaten either, right, Mu Jin?

00:50:04.070 --> 00:50:05.300
I'll order some more meat.

00:50:08.740 --> 00:50:09.740
Want a drink too?

00:50:11.780 --> 00:50:12.780
What happened?

00:50:14.810 --> 00:50:15.980
Where have you been all this time?

00:50:17.410 --> 00:50:18.520
I had to do some thinking.

00:50:19.180 --> 00:50:21.250
But I'm done thinking now.

00:50:23.190 --> 00:50:24.420
If I'm going to date you,

00:50:24.490 --> 00:50:26.160
I have to build up my strength first.

00:50:26.990 --> 00:50:28.830
If I want to withstand a typhoon,

00:50:29.660 --> 00:50:32.130
I realised that my usual strength won't be nearly enough.

00:50:40.140 --> 00:50:41.510
Does that mean you forgive me?

00:50:44.010 --> 00:50:45.010
Yes.

00:50:48.910 --> 00:50:50.750
I can only imagine how desperate you were.

00:50:51.950 --> 00:50:53.520
I understand you now, Mu Jin.

00:50:56.790 --> 00:50:58.690
Even if we break up someday,

00:50:59.260 --> 00:51:00.390
It won't be now.

00:51:01.020 --> 00:51:03.030
Break up? Why would we break up?

00:51:03.690 --> 00:51:05.700
That will never happen as long as you don't leave me.

00:51:10.500 --> 00:51:11.500
Okay.

00:51:13.200 --> 00:51:16.070
I was worried all day that you were going to break up with me.

00:51:18.440 --> 00:51:21.180
You didn't answer your phone. You didn't show up for work.

00:51:22.080 --> 00:51:23.880
I thought you were sick, so I went to your house,

00:51:25.020 --> 00:51:27.220
But Gyu Min said you went to work.

00:51:28.820 --> 00:51:30.690
I got so scared that something had really happened to you...

00:51:30.890 --> 00:51:32.660
That I was on edge all day.

00:51:35.090 --> 00:51:36.130
I'm sorry.

00:51:37.030 --> 00:51:38.830
I'm sorry for making you worry.

00:51:40.800 --> 00:51:42.900
Do you know how scared I was?

00:51:49.140 --> 00:51:50.470
Mu Jin, come on.

00:51:54.210 --> 00:51:56.880
Why are you acting like a child? People are watching.

00:51:58.180 --> 00:51:59.220
I'm sorry.

00:52:12.330 --> 00:52:16.530
I'm sorry. I'm so sorry. I'm sorry I worried you.

00:52:29.550 --> 00:52:30.910
How long do we have to wait?

00:52:55.270 --> 00:52:57.110
I'm telling you, Hyun Soo was with another girl.

00:52:57.740 --> 00:52:59.940
If you don't believe me, go and see for yourself.

00:53:07.580 --> 00:53:08.590
Hee Na.

00:53:09.350 --> 00:53:11.960
I'm at a funeral right now, so it's not a good time to talk.

00:53:13.260 --> 00:53:14.390
Is something wrong?

00:53:25.700 --> 00:53:26.870
Hey, Park Hyun Soo!

00:53:28.940 --> 00:53:30.340
You call this a funeral home?

00:53:32.240 --> 00:53:33.240
Hee Na.

00:53:34.850 --> 00:53:36.850
It's certainly a hip place.

00:53:37.210 --> 00:53:38.820
I thought you said your great-aunt passed away.

00:53:39.580 --> 00:53:41.080
Since I'm here, I might as well pay my respects.

00:53:41.450 --> 00:53:43.120
Well, Hee Na...

00:53:43.290 --> 00:53:44.590
You see...

00:53:45.620 --> 00:53:46.890
What happened was...

00:53:47.020 --> 00:53:49.590
My great-aunt almost died, but then miraculously...

00:53:49.660 --> 00:53:50.730
Hey, Park Hyun Soo.

00:53:55.370 --> 00:53:56.370
Jae Hee.

00:53:56.700 --> 00:53:57.700
Who are you?

00:53:58.440 --> 00:53:59.600
And who are you?

00:54:02.370 --> 00:54:04.110
Is this your great-aunt?

00:54:04.940 --> 00:54:05.940
What is she talking about?

00:54:07.340 --> 00:54:09.580
Hey, Park Hyun Soo. You answer me.

00:54:10.180 --> 00:54:12.250
- Who is she? - What?

00:54:16.120 --> 00:54:18.920
Are you trying to decide which one of us to dump?

00:54:19.660 --> 00:54:22.860
What are you talking about? Look, what happened was...

00:54:22.930 --> 00:54:23.990
Hey, forget it.

00:54:25.460 --> 00:54:27.260
Instead, I'm dumping you.

00:54:28.870 --> 00:54:30.530
Now you don't have to sneak around anymore.

00:54:30.870 --> 00:54:33.240
This girl, that girl, every other girl.

00:54:33.940 --> 00:54:35.110
Go date them all.

00:54:38.380 --> 00:54:41.040
- Jae Hee, wait. Hear me out. - You punk!

00:54:44.480 --> 00:54:45.480
Darn it.

00:54:51.220 --> 00:54:53.160
Hey, where are you going?

00:54:54.360 --> 00:54:56.630
Hey!

00:54:56.790 --> 00:54:57.790
Let go.

00:54:58.800 --> 00:55:01.060
Hey, happy now that you've made a fool of me and are leaving?

00:55:02.370 --> 00:55:04.200
Are you?

00:55:04.400 --> 00:55:07.400
You should be grateful that I'm ending it here.

00:55:07.670 --> 00:55:09.070
You worthless piece of trash.

00:55:10.740 --> 00:55:11.780
Unbelievable.

00:55:11.840 --> 00:55:13.010
You little punk. Darn it.

00:55:16.310 --> 00:55:17.950
What do you want, you punk?

00:55:18.580 --> 00:55:20.750
- Give me 50 dollars. - What?

00:55:21.850 --> 00:55:22.890
What do you mean by 50 dollars?

00:55:22.950 --> 00:55:25.220
Earlier, in front of the tteokbokki stand,

00:55:26.520 --> 00:55:27.890
You stole 50 dollars from the cash box...

00:55:27.960 --> 00:55:28.960
And shoved it in your pocket.

00:55:32.000 --> 00:55:33.000
What? When did I do that?

00:55:33.060 --> 00:55:34.870
When the old woman went to the restroom.

00:55:35.470 --> 00:55:36.470
Seriously?

00:55:38.740 --> 00:55:40.470
You really stole from her?

00:55:44.670 --> 00:55:45.680
Let go.

00:55:46.780 --> 00:55:47.880
Let go, darn it.

00:56:07.960 --> 00:56:08.970
Are you okay?

00:56:15.240 --> 00:56:16.370
You always seem to...

00:56:19.010 --> 00:56:21.510
See me at my most embarrassing.

00:56:21.950 --> 00:56:24.210
I have a bad memory, so I'll forget it soon.

00:56:25.750 --> 00:56:26.880
So don't worry about it.

00:56:45.540 --> 00:56:46.540
What is it?

00:56:47.600 --> 00:56:49.110
Mom's waiting for you.

00:57:04.020 --> 00:57:05.120
That girl...

00:57:06.490 --> 00:57:08.390
Did you take her to your father's grave?

00:57:10.190 --> 00:57:11.190
Yes.

00:57:13.260 --> 00:57:14.970
I thought you were just playing around...

00:57:15.030 --> 00:57:16.300
And would break up with her.

00:57:17.270 --> 00:57:18.370
Were you serious?

00:57:19.840 --> 00:57:20.840
Yes.

00:57:23.640 --> 00:57:25.340
Then if I were to tell you to break up,

00:57:25.410 --> 00:57:27.180
You wouldn't do it so easily, would you?

00:57:28.550 --> 00:57:29.550
That's right.

00:57:29.910 --> 00:57:32.480
Even if you want me to, I will never break up with her.

00:57:38.050 --> 00:57:39.160
Then what are we to do?

00:57:41.560 --> 00:57:44.060
I'll never accept that girl as long as I live.

00:57:45.560 --> 00:57:47.900
She's marrying me, not you.

00:57:48.230 --> 00:57:49.230
Is that so?

00:57:50.830 --> 00:57:51.940
Then choose.

00:57:53.370 --> 00:57:56.540
Either give up everything you enjoy thanks to me...

00:57:57.410 --> 00:57:59.240
Or dump that girl.

00:58:01.580 --> 00:58:02.580
What's it going to be?

00:58:05.420 --> 00:58:06.420
Fine.

00:58:07.080 --> 00:58:09.890
I'll give it all back. Everything I got from you.

00:58:13.420 --> 00:58:14.420
Fine.

00:58:15.260 --> 00:58:16.290
Fine, then.

00:58:17.160 --> 00:58:20.000
The stocks, real estate, and cash you have just because you're my son,

00:58:20.060 --> 00:58:21.060
And everything down to your last pair of socks.

00:58:21.130 --> 00:58:22.130
Hand it all over.

00:58:22.800 --> 00:58:24.100
And get out of here with nothing.

00:58:27.370 --> 00:58:28.370
Fine.

00:58:29.540 --> 00:58:30.670
I'll do that.

00:58:50.090 --> 00:58:51.090
Mu Jin.

00:59:30.170 --> 00:59:33.300
Mom. Mu Jin is really packing his bags.

00:59:33.370 --> 00:59:35.670
He didn't earn a single thing in this house.

00:59:36.040 --> 00:59:37.570
Tell him to leave with just the clothes on his back.

00:59:38.980 --> 00:59:39.980
Mom.

01:00:00.530 --> 01:00:01.530
Kim Mu Jin.

01:00:03.570 --> 01:00:05.100
This is just a fleeting feeling.

01:00:05.340 --> 01:00:07.900
She's not worth giving up everything you have...

01:00:08.170 --> 01:00:09.640
And risking it all.

01:00:11.670 --> 01:00:12.880
Please take care of Mom.

01:00:13.780 --> 01:00:14.780
Mu Jin.

01:00:15.350 --> 01:00:17.280
I've been through this myself.

01:00:17.680 --> 01:00:18.680
So?

01:00:19.480 --> 01:00:20.580
Don't you have any regrets?

01:00:24.020 --> 01:00:25.020
None at all.

01:00:25.220 --> 01:00:26.760
If I let Gyu Rim go now,

01:00:27.420 --> 01:00:28.730
I know I'll regret it for the rest of my life.

01:00:33.000 --> 01:00:34.000
Hey.

01:00:34.630 --> 01:00:35.930
Kim Mu Jin.

01:00:59.890 --> 01:01:02.890
(I'll Protect My Daughter! Hunger Strike: Day One)

01:01:30.450 --> 01:01:31.450
Mom.

01:01:33.160 --> 01:01:34.620
What am I going to do?

01:01:36.590 --> 01:01:37.930
I'm scared.

01:01:39.260 --> 01:01:41.030
I'm so, so scared.

01:01:48.400 --> 01:01:50.240
(Mu Jin)

01:02:08.760 --> 01:02:09.930
Hello?

01:02:10.990 --> 01:02:12.000
Were you asleep?

01:02:12.460 --> 01:02:15.730
No, I was just about to fall asleep. What about you?

01:02:17.270 --> 01:02:18.270
Are you outside?

01:02:19.270 --> 01:02:20.640
I couldn't sleep,

01:02:21.300 --> 01:02:22.810
So I came out for a walk.

01:02:32.050 --> 01:02:33.050
Gyu Rim.

01:02:34.250 --> 01:02:35.290
Yes?

01:02:38.150 --> 01:02:39.890
No matter what happens,

01:02:41.220 --> 01:02:42.460
Don't give up on me.

01:02:47.630 --> 01:02:48.630
Okay.

01:02:51.000 --> 01:02:52.000
Good.

01:02:53.100 --> 01:02:54.300
That's all I needed to hear.

01:02:58.940 --> 01:03:01.510
I love you, Mu Jin.

01:03:06.980 --> 01:03:08.320
Gyu Rim, do you realise...

01:03:09.720 --> 01:03:11.550
This is the first time you've said you love me?

01:03:13.190 --> 01:03:14.190
Really?

01:03:14.860 --> 01:03:15.860
Yes.

01:03:17.530 --> 01:03:18.800
That's all I need.

01:03:20.600 --> 01:03:21.760
For today,

01:03:22.430 --> 01:03:23.770
That's all I needed.

01:03:26.600 --> 01:03:28.170
I love you too, Han Gyu Rim.

01:03:29.810 --> 01:03:30.810
Sleep well.

01:03:32.110 --> 01:03:33.110
Sleep well.

01:04:35.740 --> 01:04:37.310
Watch out.

01:05:21.580 --> 01:05:22.950
(Love on the Menu)

01:05:23.120 --> 01:05:27.560
How badly is he hurt? It's not life-threatening, is it?

01:05:27.620 --> 01:05:28.790
Han Gyu Rim.

01:05:28.930 --> 01:05:32.230
What do you even know about Mu Jin? Didn't you notice anything?

01:05:32.300 --> 01:05:33.430
Mu Jin...

01:05:33.500 --> 01:05:35.430
Gave up everything for you.

01:05:35.500 --> 01:05:38.030
- We lost our house. - What are you talking about?

01:05:38.100 --> 01:05:39.800
From now on, it's every person for themselves.

01:05:39.870 --> 01:05:41.070
Then what about Gyu Min and Gyu Seo?

01:05:41.140 --> 01:05:43.370
I told you, we should just dump them at an orphanage.

01:05:43.440 --> 01:05:44.710
Shut your mouth, Han Gyu Young.

01:05:44.770 --> 01:05:46.910
Fine. You all have a nice life together.

01:05:47.140 --> 01:05:48.310
Just give me 100,000 dollars.

01:05:48.380 --> 01:05:50.610
For 100,000 dollars to leave Mu Jin,

01:05:50.680 --> 01:05:52.480
That seems like a pretty good deal.

